            19,
            20
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Establishment of the Golden Calves",
      "description": "Jeroboam set up two golden calves in Bethel and Dan to prevent the people from traveling to Jerusalem to worship, saying: 'Behold, your gods, O Israel, who brought you up out of Egypt.'",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 11,
          "chapter": 12,
          "verses": [
            26,
            27,
            28,
            29,
